[{"title":"仙居书屋为相国商公题","author":"童轩","text":"仙居之山几千仞兮，芙蓉万叠屼然直上而孤撑。\n攒峰西来拥其下，是为金华诸山兮，左右环拱罗立而相迎。\n红尘隔断数百里，时有彩云片片生。\n其间兮只疑方壶圆峤之在目，丹厓翠壁掩映而霄峥。\n玉堂老仙昔居此，诛茆缚屋时躬耕。\n贮书万卷日披诵，列仙环侍皆儒生。\n当窗翠屏宜晚对，飞流喷作瀑布声。\n乱藤苍苍挂寒雨，白石一径香生蘅。\n松风旦夕发清籁，彷佛天上来鸾笙。\n幽深宛似白鹿洞，翛然一段沧洲情。\n有时纵步一登眺，但见琪花瑶草不可以名状兮，上有好鸟宛宛声和鸣。\n老仙抱道非逃名，慨然有志忧疲氓。\n一朝飞步朝天京，万言披腹琅玕呈。\n玉帝见之喜，首擢桂籍魁群英。\n十年补衮作霖雨，诸方入贡歌升平。\n列仙亦继起，先后俱登瀛。\n锵锵环佩趋承明，文章班马世所惊。\n回首仙居山，嵯峨天外横。\n想当太古毓元气，间世降此长庚精。\n地灵人杰信非偶，高名可轧岱与衡。\n何须采药三山行，何须承露双金茎。\n乃知仙人在清世，秦皇汉武白首望幸空无成。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43751,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"朱寅仲写杏林春意图为内相素轩公题","author":"童轩","text":"何人貌此春意图，杏花照眼红模糊。\n滇城朱氏称好手，点染自谓当时无。\n初疑桃源在人境，溪水无风明似镜。\n落红满岸误渔船，不见秦人来问讯。\n复疑金谷桃李春，东风红紫几回新。\n豪华转首成消歇，不见花前劝酒人。\n摩挲细认久乃得，知是匡庐董仙宅。\n门外青山万仞高，香炉五老森罗列。\n天然一段幽奇趣，金削芙蓉隔旧世。\n个中茅屋几人家，流水閒云自来去。\n飞岚掩翠望中迷，古木寒藤夹岸垂。\n抱琴来访者谁子，径度不避溪桥危。\n苍苔白石连松岛，五陵游侠经过少。\n门静常时下鹿群，溪晴几见飞鸥鸟。\n先生开窗心澹如，手摊一卷岐黄书。\n平生有志在经济，不作良相为良医。\n活人不取青蚨直，种杏成林还自适。\n年年花发正春风，一片朝霞绚晴日。\n朝霞一片树头红，赤城彷佛遥相通。\n从来种德知多少，但见春深子满丛。\n实成更有于菟守，不似邻园杂花柳。\n綵云遮户最宜诗，香雪扑帘堪对酒。\n先生一去经几霜，画图高行至今扬。\n苏耽橘井应同调，王母桃花可并芳。\n文章内相耽清致，购图不惜千金费。\n高堂相对澹忘情，移得山林在城市。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43752,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吕氏节孝卷","author":"童轩","text":"金陵吕氏家本吴，少膺姆教如罗敷。\n伊昔笄年美且姝，嫁得良人君子徒。\n双飞婉转鸾凤雏，胡期一朝镜影孤。\n怀中弱婴声呱呱，高堂况有白发姑。\n昨者与君为欢娱，何忍背弃如路途。\n矢心清白永不渝，寸扃皎若秋霜俱。\n朝课儿书夜䌟纑，膏沐不御泪眼枯。\n天胡不吊姑且痡，吁天求代频号呼。\n天愈姑病不负吾，而今春秋雪满颅。\n天书褒异下清都，节孝大扁题门闾。\n我愧为儒七尺躯，行年四十百行无。\n闻母高谊敦薄夫，为作歌诗付董狐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43753,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春雨卧病书怀 其一","author":"童轩","text":"春半连朝雨，空斋睡起迟。\n闭门回俗辙，煮茗瀹诗脾。\n小菜生新甲，闲花发旧帷。\n翛然成吏隐，虚负盛明时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43754,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春雨卧病书怀 其二","author":"童轩","text":"一室朝慵扫，遗经自讨论。\n枯蜗寒缀壁，黠鼠静翻盆。\n调古谁同赏，时清道益尊。\n闲将贫富态，书向翟公门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43755,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春雨卧病书怀 其三","author":"童轩","text":"避地营书屋，萧然一二椽。\n官闲非逐客，病久似癯禅。\n犬吠南中雪，蛙鸣井底天。\n物情徒自尔，吾且守吾玄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43756,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春雨卧病书怀 其四","author":"童轩","text":"积雨空斋里，春寒未裌衣。\n道穷知己少，乡远去人稀。\n柳湿低吟槛，苔深涩旧扉。\n自惭无劲翮，不是恶群飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43757,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春雨卧病书怀 其五","author":"童轩","text":"门巷春泥滑，山川晓雾昏。\n莫言犹豹隐，端胜类鸢蹲。\n扫径除花缬，编篱护竹根。\n平生忧愤志，惆怅与谁论。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43758,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春雨卧病书怀 其六","author":"童轩","text":"密雨随风急，虚斋日晏眠。\n诗瓢高挂壁，茶灶冷炊烟。\n饮乏高阳侣，贫无负郭田。\n悠悠清梦里，吟遍衍波笺。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43759,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春雨卧病书怀 其七","author":"童轩","text":"澹泊真无事，迂疏百不能。\n守株思得兔，点笔误成蝇。\n行古从人笑，家贫免盗憎。\n居然叨素食，浑似戒州僧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43760,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春雨卧病书怀 其八","author":"童轩","text":"勿讶非吴下，深惭令海盐。\n旧琴蛇腹断，新笔鼠须尖。\n诗苦非因债，官清不为廉。\n窗前山色好，终日坐钩帘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43761,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春雨卧病书怀 其九","author":"童轩","text":"用世才偏拙，治生计益穷。\n接䍦巾倒著，榾柮火初红。\n病喜听琴愈，书因看剑工。\n茫茫天壤内，何必楚人弓。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43762,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春雨卧病书怀 其十","author":"童轩","text":"狡兔谋三窟，寒乌借一枝。\n浮名成底用，薄俗不堪医。\n竹色团书屋，芸香落砚池。\n投闲聊尔遣，知命复何疑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43763,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨中柬郑广之挥使","author":"童轩","text":"咫尺长安道，思君日倚楼。\n寒烟笼野色，春雨暗江流。\n燕麦悲新况，莺花感旧游。\n何时一相见，携手步沧洲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43764,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闲居漫兴 其一","author":"童轩","text":"卜地搆轩楹，心闲乐自生。\n土花凝碧嫩，林叶溜红轻。\n月射檐牙白，泉穿石罅清。\n自缘幽兴足，初不为逃名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43765,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闲居漫兴 其二","author":"童轩","text":"未老已偷闲，萧萧屋数间。\n杯倾螺壳紫，冠制鹿皮斑。\n隐几闻啼鸟，钩帘见远山。\n秋来无一事，衣佩尽纫兰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43766,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闲居漫兴 其三","author":"童轩","text":"举世长昏饮，畴能问独醒。\n门无题凤字，囊有换鹅经。\n种就花成锦，移来石作屏。\n闲中供一玩，相对眼偏青。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43767,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闲居漫兴 其四","author":"童轩","text":"一榻清于洗，翛然思不群。\n紫苔行处满，黄鸟坐来闻。\n琴奏梅间月，棋敲石上云。\n蒲塘新水暖，花落覆轻纹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43768,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闲居漫兴 其五","author":"童轩","text":"自识清堪乐，谁云俗可污。\n泉烹建溪茗，香霭博山垆。\n月冷梅魂瘦，风清鹤梦孤。\n近来疏懒甚，簪组意俱无。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43769,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闲居漫兴 其六","author":"童轩","text":"歧路竟喧纷，心闲苦不闻。\n字临王逸少，诗学鲍参军。\n竹里敲茶臼，花前倒酒尊。\n嵇生本高致，宁肯在鸡群。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43770,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闲居漫兴 其七","author":"童轩","text":"门径掩苍苔，清幽绝点埃。\n投闲惟乐道，多病孰怜才。\n竹每穿篱引，花常税地栽。\n一帘飞絮晚，游侠不曾来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43771,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闲居漫兴 其八","author":"童轩","text":"遁迹衡门下，栖迟得自由。\n梅花悬小帐，莲叶汎轻舟。\n事业惭鸣凤，生涯笑拙鸠。\n尘缨何处濯，门外有清流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43772,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闲居漫兴 其九","author":"童轩","text":"镇日掩柴扃，长歌醉复醒。\n草生元亮井，竹覆子云亭。\n煖玉砻棋局，秋金铸砚屏。\n都将旧游事，一笑晚山青。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43773,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闲居漫兴 其十","author":"童轩","text":"樗散真成癖，支离类隐沦。\n林深多绿藓，地僻少红尘。\n酒熟频留客，诗成不寄人。\n清风无限乐，即此见天真。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43774,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚至华阴拟唐人作","author":"童轩","text":"马首日将晡，行行岁欲徂。\n古祠寒藓合，仙掌断霞孤。\n山暝闻啼鸟，溪晴见浴凫。\n洛城知不远，宫树晚模糊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43775,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠范外史","author":"童轩","text":"寄迹朝真观，烟霞世外心。\n封书凭鹤寄，吹笛学龙吟。\n宝气千林玉，丹光满灶金。\n有时飞佩响，浑作步虚音。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43776,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题连云栈","author":"童轩","text":"鸟道由来险，经行感客心。\n蛩声吟乱叶，虎迹印深林。\n零露沾衣湿，轻岚障日阴。\n王程未可住，四牡正骎骎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43777,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"积雨青阳道中","author":"童轩","text":"淅沥连朝雨，驱驰道路中。\n泥深愁没马，草满畏飞蠓。\n重雾山含毒，惊湍石漱风。\n已将身许国，何敢怨途穷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43778,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"五丁峡","author":"童轩","text":"忆昔梁州域，曾闻贡篚来。\n孰云千里险，功自五丁开。\n溪恶蛇虫杂，林深虎豹哀。\n那堪登峻岭，我马正隤魋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43779,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寓白塔寺偶题","author":"童轩","text":"夜宿招提境，萧然世外踪。\n雨腥龙出洞，月冷鹤归松。\n影露林间塔，声传涧底钟。\n空门应不锁，常借白云封。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43780,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜坐感怀","author":"童轩","text":"独坐悲前事，悠悠十载期。\n黄芽难变骨，黑发已成丝。\n慷慨班生剑，凄凉楚客词。\n更阑不能寐，起视夜何其。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43781,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怀刘通政时用先生","author":"童轩","text":"吾乡多俊彦，夫子独超群。\n诗妙唐人法，词工汉史文。\n精忠县皎日，高谊薄行云。\n为别今三载，空怀晋鄙薰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43782,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怀康绣衣用和","author":"童轩","text":"壮岁登乌府，昂藏自不群。\n印章驱吏佩，谏草避人焚。\n面冷霜飞铁，衣香绣蹙云。\n何时重会晤，尊酒细论文。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43783,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怀刘绣衣廷高","author":"童轩","text":"乡里交游辈，情亲喜见君。\n一缄劳寄意，两地惜离群。\n白马人传疏，雕龙世爱文。\n几回驰恋切，春树暗江云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43784,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怀丘秋官时雍","author":"童轩","text":"黄甲题名姓，刑曹列缙绅。\n律身清似玉，持法蔼如云。\n白也诗无敌，羲之字有神。\n别来成间阔，几度仰清尘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43785,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怀胡绣衣以道","author":"童轩","text":"气节摩霄汉，文光射斗杓。\n礼闱高擢桂，宪府早乘轺。\n晓日听鸣凤，秋空见落雕。\n君才有如此，不负圣明朝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43786,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题林塘别业","author":"童轩","text":"林塘多胜趣，云物四时幽。\n山色供诗料，波香引钓钩。\n高原收鸭脚，浅渚摘鸡头。\n剩有烟霞癖，无烦使者求。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43787,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白沙民舍","author":"童轩","text":"初日照林扉，山深客到稀。\n柳溪莺独啭，麦陇雉双飞。\n少妇提筐出，中男荷畚归。\n盛时征赋少，生事莫嫌微。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43788,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九龙滩晚泊","author":"童轩","text":"九龙滩下泊，烟景暗苍苔。\n树影临流出，钟声渡水来。\n江空鸥伴少，风急雁群哀。\n正尔怀人切，愁云满钓台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43789,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"渔者","author":"童轩","text":"一叶扁舟里，萧条生计微。\n犬依茶灶卧，鸥逐钓丝飞。\n不识功名路，浑忘宠辱机。\n溪头新水绿，欸乃日忘归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43790,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"富阳晚眺","author":"童轩","text":"渺渺江村路，扁舟薄暮过。\n人家连竹坞，野烧接山阿。\n雁影惊秋远，潮声向晚多。\n推篷无一事，闲听棹郎歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43791,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮过山寺","author":"童轩","text":"寂寂南朝寺，荒凉露远郊。\n夕阳僧扫叶，秋雨燕辞巢。\n断碣犹横草，遗龛半覆茆。\n道傍泉涌碧，疑是虎曾跑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43792,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟中杂咏 其一","author":"童轩","text":"买得扁舟稳，浑如米氏船。\n看山篷屋坐，待月柁楼眠。\n鸥静偏怡趣，鱼多不论钱。\n南风十日好，百丈漫须牵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43793,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟中杂咏 其二","author":"童轩","text":"去去朝京国，图书满画船。\n丹枫连水驿，白鸟没江烟。\n候吏朝挝鼓，渔歌夜扣舷。\n盛时官况好，何异去登仙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43794,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟中杂咏 其三","author":"童轩","text":"秋水青于染，官河放去艭。\n波光平草阁，山色到篷窗。\n细雨猿啼独，疏烟鹭下双。\n羁怀正牢落，谁与倒银缸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43795,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟中杂咏 其四","author":"童轩","text":"翘首金台道，孤舟几日程。\n陇云迷客梦，江月照离情。\n远水连天白，高河下露清。\n不堪凉夜永，蟋蟀近人鸣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43796,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟中杂咏 其五","author":"童轩","text":"孤鹤掠予舟，横江白露浮。\n天长秋水阔，云净晚霞收。\n斗酒聊相慰，江山足壮游。\n篷窗今夜月，应似在黄州。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43797,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟中杂咏 其六","author":"童轩","text":"薄暮推篷坐，吟怀自爽然。\n青山遮驿小，白鹭点波圆。\n野旷风生籁，江空月在船。\n夜阑清不寐，屡欲挟飞仙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43798,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴江道中","author":"童轩","text":"挂席吴江路，长吟趣不穷。\n轻凫眠野艇，鲜鲫上丝筒。\n照水蒹葭白，酣霜橘柚红。\n此中乡土好，应不愧豳风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43799,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东林小隐卷为沈处士题 其二","author":"童轩","text":"游侠经过少，衡门尽日扃。\n草香侵座绿，山色堕楼青。\n野服裁荷芰，园蔬煮茯苓。\n翛然尘市外，不减聘君亭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43800,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"孤雁","author":"童轩","text":"离群应已久，远地只孤飞。\n月冷呼声疾，云閒顾影稀。\n萧萧蒲苇老，粒粒稻粱微。\n几夜回塘梦，分明向北归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43801,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"广陵","author":"童轩","text":"日暮添乡思，孤舟宿广陵。\n晚风摇酒旆，寒雨湿渔罾。\n影暗原头树，光微渡口灯。\n故园何处是，归梦杳难凭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43802,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"清河","author":"童轩","text":"日暮劳行役，官河驻短篷。\n渔灯寒照水，牧笛夜吹风。\n缺月斜窗入，流云极浦通。\n不堪吟望断，天外叫孤鸿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43803,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟经武城有怀同年伍令尹","author":"童轩","text":"寂寞居民少，萧条古木疏。\n岸明残雪在，川暝落霞初。\n渡口人看雁，湾头妪卖鱼。\n临风思茂宰，掩袂一欷歔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43804,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"流河","author":"童轩","text":"早发流河路，西风岁晏时。\n白烟连远戍，黄叶下高枝。\n野老趋乡集，渔郎祀水祠。\n太平风土好，随处乐雍熙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43805,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"砖河","author":"童轩","text":"夜泊砖河驿，乡山此地赊。\n朔云低度雁，关树冷啼鸦。\n宦况忧来薄，羁怀病后加。\n不堪归梦断，明月满天涯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43806,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"景州道傍古碣","author":"童轩","text":"遗碣知何代，离离碧藓迷。\n夕阳牛砺角，秋雨蚓蟠泥。\n牧竖群敲火，行人半认题。\n空遗千古恨，愁绝岘山西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43807,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戊子冬备员朝觐侨寓湾中逆旅值风雪大作有感","author":"童轩","text":"憔悴穷途客，馀生只自怜。\n怀人长两地，去国又三年。\n白发悲难变，青袍弊欲穿。\n不堪风雪夜，梦绕紫云边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43808,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与许汉英秀才夜话","author":"童轩","text":"白下栖迟地，睽违又十年。\n蹉跎双鬓改，险阻一身全。\n夜雨溪南业，秋风墓下田。\n别来空有梦，惆怅未能还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43809,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雪","author":"童轩","text":"旅馆人初到，长空雪正浮。\n和云埋野树，杂雨响江楼。\n冻涩班生剑，寒欺晏子裘。\n凭谁歌郢曲，一洗客边愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43810,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"塞上","author":"童轩","text":"万里隋城北，愁云一望迷。\n雪深边马健，月黑陇狐凄。\n远戍连烽火，寒沙莽蒺藜。\n将军多暇日，游猎玉关西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43811,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"除夕","author":"童轩","text":"旅馆逢除夕，凄凉岁欲徂。\n异乡家是客，薄宦病为躯。\n华发欺人老，青灯伴影孤。\n春风明日至，谁共饮屠苏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43812,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶书","author":"童轩","text":"自笑谋生拙，箪瓢屡晏如。\n贫无求米帖，病有绝交书。\n补履空惭剑，逢危欲戒车。\n何时拂衣去，重拟结蜗庐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43813,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"禄膘驿和祝廷瑞侍御壁间诗韵","author":"童轩","text":"京国云山远，悠悠入梦思。\n频年縻薄宦，何日是归期。\n鱼雁音书杳，风霜道路迟。\n窗前残月白，起视夜何其。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43814,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鹤庆道中","author":"童轩","text":"岩深多险阻，马足正淩兢。\n暝雪依巢鸟，斜阳归寺僧。\n林疏鸣败叶，涧古积坚冰。\n去去无辞远，荒山又几层。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43815,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]